# ADR-0003 update: direct submission to OPF (Capabilities 2, 3 and 10)

Story ENTPMTS-144880. Architecture decision of 2026-10-23: Wire II and Submit Request to OPF API are combined into one service, `bank-wire-ii-api`. There is no SQS between them and no MQ from OPF. PayX retries. The idempotency key comes from upstream (the UETR) and is passed to FIS unchanged. Wire II sends the final status to PayX by an API call. Capability 2 covers only the OPF API registration and connection.

