**With**
> This capability covers only the registration of the OPF API and the connection to it: establishing, securing and cataloguing the integration. Generating the pain.001.001.11 JSON (Capability 10) and submitting each payment and handling its response (Capability 3) are both done by the Wire II service, `bank-wire-ii-api`.

